    "html": "<section id=\"about\" class=\"w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-20 scroll-mt-24\" aria-label=\"About Miftah Fentaw\"><div class=\"transform-gpu opacity-0 pointer-events-none motion-reduce:opacity-100 motion-reduce:pointer-events-auto \"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4 sm:mb-5 leading-tight px-1\">Crafting scalable, impactful software systems and many more…</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-4\">I take complex business requirements and engineer systems that scale. From designing resilient data models to architecting clean, maintainable codebases, I focus on delivering software that performs under real-world conditions.</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 sm:mb-10\">I own the entire product lifecycle—from initial system design through deployment—ensuring high reliability and a seamless user experience.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:gap-4 max-w-lg mx-auto\"><div class=\"glass-card rounded-2xl rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl px-2 sm:px-3 py-4 sm:py-5 text-center\"><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white\">4+</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-[0.6rem] sm:text-xs mt-1 leading-tight\">Years Experience</p></div><div class=\"glass-card rounded-2xl rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl px-2 sm:px-3 py-4 sm:py-5 text-center\"><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white\">30+</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-[0.6rem] sm:text-xs mt-1 leading-tight\">Projects Completed</p></div><div class=\"glass-card rounded-2xl rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl px-2 sm:px-3 py-4 sm:py-5 text-center\"><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white\">20+</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:tex